<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 996 0 R
/T (The result is a systematic retrieval failure: tokens with near-identical surface text but structurally-opposed semantic roles are assigned dangerously similar embedding vectors, causing RAG systems to surface structurally wrong context and language models to reason confidently from incorrect information.)
/E (The result is a systematic retrieval failure: tokens with near-identical surface text but structurally-opposed semantic roles are assigned dangerously similar embedding vectors, causing RAG systems to surface structurally wrong context and language models to reason confidently from incorrect information.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
250 0 obj
<<
