/S /H2
/P 997 0 R
/T (Embedding Models which are widely used; None of them structurally discriminate - because the architectural blind spot exists at the position encoding layer. Scaling training data over a broken inductive bias produces a more confident wrong answer, not a correct one.)
/E (Embedding Models which are widely used; None of them structurally discriminate - because the architectural blind spot exists at the position encoding layer. Scaling training data over a broken inductive bias produces a more confident wrong answer, not a correct one.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
